    "q-163715": {
      "dom_id": "step-q163715",
      "name": "Question 20",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14217845/assets/5b7552bbde56a68bfca44adb0501a4a4a8ae0a1105d3dc9039d05bfb6fd405c9.png)\n\nGiven that $R$ is the type III region shown above, \n${∭}_{R}2y\\,\\text{d}V=$",
      "worked_solution": "For a type III region $R$ with projection $D$ onto the $xz$-plane, the triple integral of a continuous function $f(x,y,z)$ over $R$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}V={∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{{u}_{1}(x,z)}^{{u}_{2}(x,z)}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe consider the region $R$ as a type III region enclosed between the back surface $y={u}_{1}(x,z)=1$ and the front surface $y={u}_{2}(x,z)=2.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14217845/assets/2f1112a1fa4e540ce8ef2d1337383a2adcb378ba519cfb9c49a4521e5bc1b02f.png)\n\nSo, the region $R$ is given by\n\n$$\nR=\\{(x,y,z)\\,:\\,(x,z)\\in D,\\,1\\le y\\le 2\\}.\n$$\n\nNow, we consider the projection $D$ as a type II *plane* region in the $xz$-plane with the left curve\n\n$$\nx={z}^{2}.\n$$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14217845/assets/2dcbae12ed3351892c63117f86bab7ffe6e1818b7a16666b42c2efdcc6bd787f.png)\n\nHence, $D=\\{(x,z)\\,:\\,0\\le z\\le 1,\\,{z}^{2}\\le x\\le 1\\}.$\n\nTherefore, we write the triple integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∭}_{R}2y\\,\\text{d}V & ={∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{1}^{2}2y\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{z}^{2}}^{1}[{\\int }_{1}^{2}2y\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{z}^{2}}^{1}[{y}^{2}]_{y=1}^{y=2}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{z}^{2}}^{1}3\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}z\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-163715-a",
